:''For the enemy, see [[Malevolent Macho Leg Cat]].''
'''Brainwashed Gross Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]], [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day Capsules]], [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] and [[Miracle 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Miracle 4 Selection]] events. He was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] increases [[Surge Attack|Surge]] level to 4.

